{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_nowell_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_nowell_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"当我们人生开始时","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_nowell_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"4400df9c7bae9da0b495ac1f1086731adcc1769c656215717b1c2cdd3a28fc63","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊恐的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃......呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......您——请您冷......冷静！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们已经派人去找干员诺威尔了！所以，也许现在您可以先把那根针，从她太阳穴挪——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苍老的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在他出现之前，我不会动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苍老的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但你们最好也不要轻举妄动，否则我不能保证那时候......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苍老的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我还能像现在这样，很好地控制自己的手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ri_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼——呼——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我来了，是谁，怎么——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"诺威尔先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我。你是......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃尔洛奇卡先生，干员诺威尔已经到了，您先把针放下吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你叫埃尔洛奇卡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不记得我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也对。我的模样已经和我们上次见面时有很大变化，你认不出也很正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我的确不记得你，但你说要找我，我来了。所以，我用自己来交换你手里的人质，好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我现在要往前走了，你也可以慢慢把小姑娘放开了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你一个人过来，在离我两步的位置停下。然后我会放开她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"空手过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"诺威尔先生，请小心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"诺威尔将手中的施术单元和配镜箱都放下，朝老人抬手示意，接着向前走去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再往前一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我照你说的做了。接下来，该你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊恐的干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——呃——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别紧张，我言出必行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......离开伦蒂尼姆之后，我经以前的顾客推荐，找到罗德岛本舰，加入了他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛是一家制药公司，专精矿石病研究与治疗。他们在很多地方都设有办事处和医疗点，这就是我再次出现在这片土地上的原因。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，矿石病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你还能治愈绝症？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"严格意义上说，那不在我的职能范围之内，我也没有那样的能力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"对，你是个配镜师。配镜师算什么医生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉，但掌握一些基础的医术和救援知识，就的确足以让我从事广义上的“救人”工作了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"一个费尽心力想死却死不掉的人，开始把救人作为毕生事业。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"该死，你肯定在跟我开玩笑......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是玩笑，埃尔洛奇卡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说了很多，那你呢？你大费周章地找我，难道只是为了这样叙叙旧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是这样，那就算先前你不用武器威胁那些小朋友，他们也会领你来找我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是说，你只是还和以前一样冲动，一样戏剧化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"我没指望用这个方法让你立刻认出我来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"因为那边，你们的人在收医疗帐篷。你们要搬走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在乌萨斯，治疗矿石病的医疗点为什么需要像杂耍班子一样随时流动，你应该比我更清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，矿石病、纠察队、公民权利......老生常谈。但这些都不是我要说的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"知道你在这里，我第一时间就赶过来了，却只看到你们的人在收拾东西准备离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"入口那顶帐篷里，只有刚才被我挟持的那个孩子在忙活。她对我道歉，说现在暂时不收治病人，你们要搬去其他地方了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"你说的对。我本来应该跟她说清我不是病人，问她这里有没有一个叫“诺威尔”的人，能不能带我去见他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"但我等不了了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......难道你一直在找我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"我说过了，我言出必行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要再过去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"你给我让开，让我回去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我要和他们在一起，即便是死——也死在一处！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什么用呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"你——你说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说，你现在进去又有什么用？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我让开，让你走进火里，和家人死在一起......最后谁也不会记得这里发生过什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"那也好过只有我一个人苟活！我不是那样的懦夫！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你才是那个当事人。你不会不明白，究竟怎么做才会让你成为真正的懦夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们选错了边，就必定有人要承受后果。但如果“灭口”的行动来得比皇帝的敕令更早——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那在这场人为的惨剧之后，幸存者即使获罪，下场最坏也不过是被流放。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"什......你到底在说什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说得已经够明白了。他们牺牲了自己，为了保护你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"保护我？呵......哈哈哈哈哈！保护我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是！肯定是你，是你杀了他们，是吗？还说这是他们的选择，为了保护我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......埃尔洛奇卡，这是你的名字，嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你听好了，埃尔洛奇卡。我只是一名路过的配镜师，甚至不是个乌萨斯人，我从不打算主动介入你们的纷争。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是来还一个人情。你父亲让我救你，我做了，仅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为我会相信你的狡辩——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我以为你会更聪明一些。毕竟你看上去也不算年轻了，而冲动又戏剧化通常是年轻人的特权。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈。我知道是你——一定是你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"因为如果真像你说的，你只是个小小的配镜师，那你又怎么会知道这么多？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"除非你本来就深入其中......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"对，对。一定是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我要杀了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我要杀了你！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你真能做到，那我只会感谢你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"火场中漆黑的烟灰已经沾染了乌萨斯青年的双手。没有多加思考，他举起此刻身上唯一的武器，直直捅向眼前不为所动的男人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"然而匕首偏离了心脏，没入男人肋下几寸，似乎就被骨头卡住，再也拔不出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"——该死——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"你——你为什么不躲？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为，如果你真的能杀死我，那这份解脱，甚至算得上是最好的生日礼物了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尽管我已经忘记我的生日......太久太久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"你难道认为挑衅我能让自己的死相更好看些？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不确定。我猜你只能继续动手，试试看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"——哈——哈——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃——咳！咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么你就是不死？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳......呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"相信我，我试过，几乎所有办法。"},{"type":"narration","text":"诺威尔吞下再度涌上喉头的鲜血。他知道再过片刻，自己身上那些伤口就会奇迹般地愈合。奇迹，当然。\n于是在片刻的静止后，他就伸手撑住自己，慢慢从雪地上爬起。\n疼痛仍在，只是从不留于表面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我见过许多类似的悲剧，在维多利亚，在莱塔尼亚，甚至在高卢。而发生在你身上的，只是比那些场面干净得多的翻版。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要雪一直像这样下着，便会掩埋所有腌臜的痕迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"闭嘴——闭嘴！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就快站不稳了，埃尔洛奇卡，所以与其浪费最后一点力气，不如听我说完。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我见过这些，是因为我受到了诅咒。我会一直活下去，除非找到一样我无论如何都不可能再拥有的东西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你真有这样神奇的体质，那还有什么东西是你找不到的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸福。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我发誓，如果你是在跟我开玩笑——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像我来到这里，也是为了走遍所有能去到的地方，寻找那个诅咒我的凶手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而我所见的越多，就越痛苦。这痛苦越庞大，我就离幸福、离死亡的解脱越远。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我不会说“至少你活下来了”这样的话，这没什么好庆祝的。我只能告诉你，至少你还有选择的权利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以选，是走进火场里，还是用别的方法杀死自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又或者，如果你仍然怪罪于我，想杀死我，那就活下去，然后......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像我寻找那个凶手一样，来找我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你不能......你不能走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你走了，我又要去哪里才能找到你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要听实话吗？我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能做的只有给你一个信物。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"我说过，我会来找你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"而这是你当时给我的信物。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"诺威尔看向老人手中的东西。\n一副眼镜，镜片已经破碎，一侧的镜架几经修补，显然受到了岁月无情的洗礼，而另一侧的镜架却几乎光洁如新。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你还留着它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"当然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有没有说过，我打造它的时候，是想用它来结束自己的性命？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，那时我没有成功。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"诺威尔接过眼镜，将光洁如新的那支眼镜腿从镜架上抽出。\n两个人都注视着那枚镶嵌其中的尖锐长针。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"你没有，但我可以想象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人们还说乌萨斯人都缺乏想象力呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"如果想象已经是我们渡过某些悲惨境遇的唯一途径，那这片大地上的多数人都不会缺乏这种能力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也对。只有想象，唯有想象......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你还打磨了它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？我想至少应该不是为了用它去劫持一个什么也不知道的年轻人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直在找你，你知道这意味着什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你言出必行，还是要杀死我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"对，但也不完全对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的确也到了说胡话的年纪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"我清楚地知道自己在说什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃尔洛奇卡，你只能选择杀我，或者不杀。生死不容暧昧地描述，也通常没有中间态。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"诺威尔把针插回眼镜里，交还给眼前迟暮的老人。\n老人短促地笑了一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"那如果我既是来杀你，也是来救你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我意识到，我几乎不能因为那场悲剧而去仇恨任何具体的人......且对那背后更庞大的东西也无能为力呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾经和这片大地拥有一些联系，转眼间却又全部失去，甚至不能因此憎恨任何人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但你还是执着于寻找我，就像我曾经执着于......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"因为只有我活下来了，我看到困境，却无能为力。我就这样活着，却不算真的活着！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，是的，我理解了你。你曾经救了我，找到你的念头又支撑我活到现在，所以我想，我应该报答你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直活着，是因为曾受到让我无法死去的诅咒。而你活下来，只因为你是一个顽强的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"顽强——哈，顽强！就让我们当作是这样吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"你离开之后，我被抓住，流放到矿场，却幸运地在感染矿石病前被再次征召入伍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"而在战场上，我又一次一次与死亡擦肩而过，无数次成为那个“幸运的家伙”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"那时我就决定，一定要找到一种能杀死任何人的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在你找到了，是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我觉得我......找到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"老人眼中闪着与年龄不符的光亮。他目光灼灼，抓住诺威尔的双手，将一个玻璃瓶放到他手中。\n诺威尔只看到浑浊的液体在玻璃瓶里晃荡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是我的报答，诺威尔。不必再无望地寻找幸福，只需要喝下去就能使一切结束——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"我完成我的复仇，你得到你的解脱。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ri_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔细的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首字母顺序......埃尔洛奇卡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔细的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找到了！电子记录坏了，还好有文字留档。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔细的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"军用背包......面包、水壶、两本书、四枚勋章、一张照片......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔细的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"灰色外套里有一副眼镜和——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔细的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......两个装着液体的玻璃瓶？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔细的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玻璃瓶内容物呢？没有当场监督他饮用或者开瓶检查？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔细的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死，没有......没有！他都能带进来麦秆那么粗的针了，谁知道玻璃瓶里会是什么东西！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔细的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他现在——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔细的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他现在和干员诺威尔待在一起，诺威尔先生还没带他的施术单元，我得赶紧——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔细的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"诺威尔——诺威尔先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔细的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她冲出去，却只来得及看到老人向诺威尔用力挥出一拳，正中前胸。\n而诺威尔几乎毫不避让，被打得接连后退几步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔细的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——呃——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔细的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"诺威尔先生！你怎么样？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔细的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"发生什么事了？他为什么要打你？而且，他有没有拿出什么奇怪的东西......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"医疗干员的注意力转向地面。那里，一个玻璃瓶被砸破在雪地里，液体的颜色很快消融，只留下一摊碎片和一块深色的印记。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔细的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"等她再抬头，老人已经离开营地，身影消失在前方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔细的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"诺威尔先生，你还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔细的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们发生了冲突？你有哪里受伤了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没有，没关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们只是叙旧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"即使是你，面对这样的诱惑也需要考虑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"我能理解，只是留给你我的时间不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我是在想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要怎么才能恰当地表达拒绝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"......你已经不再渴望死亡了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每天我都比前一天更期盼它的到来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"那你没理由拒绝，除非你也是个懦夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的品性从来跟勇敢两字相距甚远，但这也不是理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃尔洛奇卡，你知道能杀死我的只有幸福。就像非自愿的长生一样，这是由某种傲慢的、超自然的存在给我定下的规则。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而现在，你宣称用一瓶毒药就可以打破它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那如果我告诉你，你现在将那根针取出来扎进我的太阳穴，或刺穿我的颈动脉，也可以达到同样的效果呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"什......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经不再是长生者了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"你想表达什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经见过了那个降下诅咒的家伙，找到了能杀死我的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今我站在这里，做的这些救人的活计......一切都与这个事实相关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你想告诉我，你既完成了复仇，还在这里找到了幸福？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"在这群做着治愈绝症的白日梦的人当中，找到了幸福？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以这样说，但重点是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"重点是，死亡已经在向我走来的路上，埃尔洛奇卡。但如果你坚持要我现在就喝下这毒药，我也会照做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"选择权在你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是在报答你，只是在杀死你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但发泄出来，你会好过很多。只是在医疗点搬离之前，我还有一副眼镜没有做完，是要给这里一个小女孩的，他们都叫她卡佳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我做完眼镜，喝下毒药，或许你也可以帮我把眼镜带给她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会留下遗书表明是自杀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到时候，如果我会有葬礼，我希望你能来参加。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"哈——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"你认真的，诺威尔？你把我，一个无论动机如何都是来杀你的人，当成许愿池？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我把你当成一位难得的旧友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"那恐怕你要失望了，因为我这个旧友什么也不会为你做了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"老人猛地从诺威尔手里夺回玻璃瓶掷向地面，不给对方任何反应的时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃尔洛奇卡——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"都到这个时候了，我带着毒药来找你，你却天杀的还想着要救我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"拯救我，宽慰我，帮助我，把自己置于这样的位置能让你感到幸福，是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"可我偏不让你心想事成！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"你看清楚了，诺威尔。你救不了我，因为即将杀死我的不是疾病，也不是战场上的流弹，而是无可阻挡的衰老——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"而如果你说的都是真的，那你很快也会体会到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每一句都是真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"随你怎么说，反正我永远不会知道答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你为什么要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......所以，不是留给“我们”的时间不多了，而是......你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道自己时日无多了，是吗？你急于找到我，也是因为——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"还要多谢你，让我蹉跎半生，到最后却报不了仇，也报不了恩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，当然，你在你漫长的人生中一定也见过很多过得和我一样荒谬的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那不是荒谬，埃尔洛奇卡。那只是痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"痛苦曾是我们在生活里唯一能紧紧抓住的东西，真正荒谬的......是使人沦落至此的存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"承认痛苦存在并不可耻，如果我能帮助你——我还能为你做些什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"你什么也做不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你需要，我可以只用玻璃瓶的碎片。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但说真的，我不明白。假如你不想让我心想事成，那你更应该在这里杀了我，不是吗？以断绝任何我出手救你的可能——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"不，别说了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道，救人是我如今的毕生事业。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"那好，你站稳了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你改变主意了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"就只是，你给我站稳了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳咳！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"你说的对，真正荒谬的不是我，所以我更不需要你的怜悯，诺威尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔细的干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——诺威尔先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇定的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"我们两清了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔细的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"诺威尔先生，诺威尔先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，抱歉，我刚才可能走神了。你说了什么吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔细的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一会儿你得去做个全面检查，看看刚才那一拳有没有伤到肋骨之类的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔细的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，对了，还有小卡佳的眼镜，是不是快做好了？我们明天早上就要搬去下一个城镇了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，今晚就能做好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仔细的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们先回帐篷里去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你先去吧，我没问题。你也知道，我受伤通常都恢复得很快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，谢谢你出来找我，只是现在我得收拾一下这些东西......这些玻璃碎片。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_4173_nowell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"免得因为它们都埋在雪里，被其他人或者驮兽踩到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
